chx:X_InputsAndOutputs chx:hasOwner chx:X_Transaction .
chx:X_TransactionFee chx:hasOwner chx:X_Transaction .
chx:X_Block chx:hasOwner chx:X_Confirmation .
chx:X_Timestamp chx:hasOwner chx:X_Block .
